{"id":"fd293da57bc98716","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-giraud-small-site-representation.md","title":"Theorem — Giraud 的小站点表示","display":"Theorem — Giraud 的小站点表示","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-giraud-small-site-representation","aliases":["14-thm-giraud-small-site-representation"],"display":"Theorem — Giraud 的小站点表示","depends_on":["[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","[[14-df-small-category]]","[[14-df-small-site]]","[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","[[14-df-category-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-giraud-small-site-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-giraud-small-site-representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Giraud 的小站点表示"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e748a8b3caef6a6\" href=\"?note=2e748a8b3caef6a6\" title=\"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos\">14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"898681611f432286\" href=\"?note=898681611f432286\" title=\"14-df-small-category\">14-df-small-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5036bba7ca747e71\" href=\"?note=5036bba7ca747e71\" title=\"14-df-small-site\">14-df-small-site</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c502117a84587a7c\" href=\"?note=c502117a84587a7c\" title=\"14-df-category-equivalence\">14-df-category-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e748a8b3caef6a6\" href=\"?note=2e748a8b3caef6a6\" title=\"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos\">14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos</a> 的 Giraud 条件；站点与层范畴见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5036bba7ca747e71\" href=\"?note=5036bba7ca747e71\" title=\"14-df-small-site\">14-df-small-site</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a>；小指 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathcal C,J\\ (\\operatorname{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{IsSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\land\\mathcal E\\simeq\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathcal C,J\\ (\\operatorname{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{IsSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\land\\mathcal E\\simeq\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：原书 Appendix，Giraud 表示定理。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小索引的生成对象族在有限极限下闭合得到本质小的全子范畴，再对对象和 Hom 集重标号，得到实际 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小的站点；不要求环境范畴中对象的原始编码属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>。覆盖定义为联合满射族；Yoneda 型比较函子使用普遍余极限与有效等价关系证明本质满射和全忠实。这里只核对源定理与修订条件，未重新机器证明全定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos","status":"resolved","id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-small-site","status":"resolved","id":"5036bba7ca747e71","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-site]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-site-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"c502117a84587a7c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos","status":"resolved","id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 满足 [[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]] 的 Giraud 条件；站点与层范畴见 [[14-df-small-site]]、[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]；小指 $\\mathcal U$-小。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-small-site","status":"resolved","id":"5036bba7ca747e71","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 满足 [[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]] 的 Giraud 条件；站点与层范畴见 [[14-df-small-site]]、[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]；小指 $\\mathcal U$-小。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-site-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 满足 [[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]] 的 Giraud 条件；站点与层范畴见 [[14-df-small-site]]、[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]；小指 $\\mathcal U$-小。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\mathcal C,J\\ (\\operatorname{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{IsSite}(\\mathcal C,J)\\land\\mathcal E\\simeq\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false}],"bytes":1355,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-293","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-giraud-small-site-representation|Theorem — Giraud 的小站点表示]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-giraud-small-site-representation]]"},{"id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"来源：用户所给条目标注原书 Appendix 的 Giraud 定理。这里沿用 Giraud 条件作 Grothendieck 拓扑斯的定义；小站点表示另见 [[14-thm-giraud-small-site-representation]]。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-294","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-giraud-small-site-representation|Theorem — Giraud 的小站点表示]]"}],"outgoing":["2e748a8b3caef6a6","898681611f432286","5036bba7ca747e71","e21364f5dcced9e7","c502117a84587a7c"]}